        <h1 id='case-agilitybandits-title'>Agility Bandits</h1>
        <p class='case-subtitle'>
          An API-driven dog-agility blog with public articles and authenticated publishing tools.
        </p>

        <dl class='case-summary' aria-label='Project summary'>
          <div>
            <dt>Role</dt>
            <dd>Brand, UX/UI, and front-end development</dd>
          </div>
